# Azure Speech (optional) — powers narration in the presenter-notes window:
# the "Play with narration" toggle and the Jenny/Brian voice picker. Nothing
# else in Connected Deck needs a backend or a .env at all; this is the one
# feature that does. See README.md's "Presenter mode & narration" section.
#
# Get a key: Azure Portal -> create a "Speech" resource -> Keys and Endpoint.
#
# Copy this file to .env, fill in your values, then `npm run dev` (which
# starts both the Vite dev server and the narrate server together).
# AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=...
# AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=eastus
